content.text:
I don't think that our postcss custom media plugin is resolving correctly. formats/components/src/components/billboard.css has:

```
.pfx-billboard.-clickable:hover {
  border-style: dashed;
  border-color: var(--instui-color-text-base);
}

@media (--theme-canvas),
(--theme-canvas-high-contrast) {
  .pfx-billboard.-clickable:hover {
    border-color: var(--instui-component-link-text-color);
  }
}
```

however, the only rule that gets inserted into the live vitepress docs site when switching themes to showcase the `@example` + theme switcher is:

```
.instui-billboard.-clickable:hover {
	border-style: dashed;
	border-color: var(--instui-color-text-base);
}
```

